\contentsline {table}{\numberline {11.1}{\ignorespaces Current conditional synthesis of channels 14--36. These are analysis statuses, not final operations commands. ``Forecast-feasible'' means that the recorded policy enters the present dilation-tolerance region; it does not waive the transfer and estimator validations listed in the final column.}}{105}{table.11.1}%
